i</surname><given-names>PW</given-names></name><name><surname>Hay</surname><given-names>SI</given-names></name><name><surname>Muga</surname><given-names>RO</given-names></name><name><surname>Snow</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Creating spatially defined databases for equitable health service planning in low-income countries: the example of Kenya</article-title><source>Acta Tropica</source><year>2004</year><volume>91</volume><fpage>239</fpage><lpage>251</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15246930</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Peterson</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Nsugwa-Sabiti</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Were</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Coping with paediatric referral &#x02013; Ugandan parents&#x02019; experience</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2004</year><volume>363</volume><fpage>1955</fpage><lpage>1956</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15194257</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schneider</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Palmer</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Getting to the truth? Researching user views of primary health care</article-title><source>Health Policy and Planning</source><year>2002</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>32</fpage><lpage>41</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11861584</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b19"><citation citation-type="book"><collab>WHO</collab><source>Health Systems: Improving Performance</source><year>2000</year><publisher-loc>Geneva</publisher-loc><publisher-name>WHO</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="b20"><citation citation-type="book"><collab>WHO</collab><source>Bridging the &#x0201c;Know&#x02013;Do&#x0201d; Gap. Meeting on Knowledge Translation in Global Health</source><year>2005</year><publisher-loc>Geneva</publisher-loc><publisher-name>WHO</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>